    "solution": [
      "import pandas as pd",
      "",
      "df = pd.read_csv(\"store_sales.csv\")",
      "df[\"revenue\"] = df[\"unit_price\"] * df[\"quantity\"] * (1 - df[\"discount\"])",
      "",
      "products = pd.read_csv(\"products.csv\")",
      "",
      "merged = df.merge(products, on=\"product\", how=\"left\", validate=\"many_to_one\")",
      "merged[\"profit\"] = (merged[\"unit_price\"] * (1 - merged[\"discount\"]) - merged[\"unit_cost\"]) * merged[\"quantity\"]",
      "",
      "supplier_profit = merged.groupby(\"supplier\")[\"profit\"].sum().round(2).sort_values(ascending=False)",
      "",
      "g = merged.groupby(\"product\")[[\"profit\", \"revenue\"]].sum()",
      "best_margin_product = (g[\"profit\"] / g[\"revenue\"]).idxmax()",
      "",
      "print(len(df), len(merged))",
      "print(supplier_profit)",
      "print(best_margin_product)"
    ],
    "solution_explanation": [
      "لاحظ أن `products.csv` فيه أيضاً عمود `category`، فيظهر في الدمج `category_x` و `category_y`. هذا لا يؤثر على هذا التمرين، لكن في العمل الحقيقي اختر الأعمدة التي تحتاجها قبل الدمج."
    ]
